      "message": "`ctx.runfiles(files \u003d ...)` only includes the direct outputs of `srcs` and `data` plus the single `node` executable. Consider merging transitive `default_runfiles` from `ctx.attr.srcs + ctx.attr.data` (and using `nodeinfo.tool_files` instead of just `[node]`) so targets in `data` that carry their own runfiles work as expected.",
